{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 7,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, keep my words,\nAnd lay up my commandments with thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Keep my commandments and live;\nAnd my law as the apple of thine eye.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Bind them upon thy fingers;\nWrite them upon the tablet of thy heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Say unto wisdom, Thou art my sister;\nAnd call understanding ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thy",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " kinswoman:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That they may keep thee from the strange woman,\nFrom the foreigner that flattereth with her words.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For at the window of my house\nI looked forth through my lattice;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I beheld among the simple ones,\nI discerned among the youths,\nA young man void of understanding,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Passing through the street near her corner;\nAnd he went the way to her house,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the twilight, in the evening of the day,\nIn the middle of the night and in the darkness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And, behold, there met him a woman\nWith the attire of a harlot, and wily of heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "(She is clamorous and wilful;\nHer feet abide not in her house:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now she is in the streets, now in the broad places,\nAnd lieth in wait at every corner.)",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So she caught him, and kissed him,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with an impudent face she said unto him:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Sacrifices of peace-offerings are with me;\nThis day have I paid my vows.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore came I forth to meet thee,\nDiligently to seek thy face, and I have found thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have spread my couch with carpets of tapestry,\nWith striped cloths of the yarn of Egypt.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have perfumed my bed\nWith myrrh, aloes, and cinnamon.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Come, let us take our fill of love until the morning;\nLet us solace ourselves with loves.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the man is not at home;\nHe is gone a long journey:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath taken a bag of money with him;\nHe will come home at the full moon.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "With her much fair speech she causeth him to yield;\nWith the flattering of her lips she forceth him along.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He goeth after her straightway,\nAs an ox goeth to the slaughter,\nOr as ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fetters to the correction of the fool;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Till an arrow strike through his liver;\nAs a bird hasteth to the snare,\nAnd knoweth not that it is for his life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now therefore, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sons, hearken unto me,\nAnd attend to the words of my mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let not thy heart decline to her ways;\nGo not astray in her paths.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For she hath cast down many wounded:\nYea, all her slain are a mighty host.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.7.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.7.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Her house is the way to Sheol,\nGoing down to the chambers of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
